ndia.indiatimes.com/photo/135386048.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/architect-of-akhand-bharat-pm-modi-amit-shah-pay-tribute-to-sardar-patel-on-birth-anniversary/articleshow/135386048.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/architect-of-akhand-bharat-pm-modi-amit-shah-pay-tribute-to-sardar-patel-on-birth-anniversary/articleshow/135386048.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T08:59:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135386048,imgsize-32050.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NMC invites applications to empanel 17 standing counsels across Supreme Court, 16 High Court positions]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-invites-applications-to-empanel-17-standing-counsels-across-supreme-court-16-high-court-positions/articleshow/135384841.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135384841.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The National Medical Commission is seeking applications for standing counsels aimed at bolstering its legal expertise. Eligible advocates should possess significant experience in medical law and institutional matters before High Courts, meeting defined criteria such as years of practice and court appearances. Selected advocates will be responsible for drafting legal documents, conducting research, and updating on case progress.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-invites-applications-to-empanel-17-standing-counsels-across-supreme-court-16-high-court-positions/articleshow/135384841.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-invites-applications-to-empanel-17-standing-counsels-across-supreme-court-16-high-court-positions/articleshow/135384841.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T07:57:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135384874,imgsize-106551.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Over 42,000 candidates to take FMGE on Saturday; NBEMS deploys 4,500-plus personnel, live CCTV surveillance]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/over-42000-candidates-to-take-fmge-on-saturday-nbems-deploys-4500-plus-personnel-live-cctv-surveillance/articleshow/135384736.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135384736.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[This Saturday, over 42,000 aspiring doctors will participate in the Foreign Medical Graduate Examination. The NBEMS has officially registered 42,438 candidates, with 42,109 now holding their admit cards. To ensure a smooth process, more than 4,500 personnel will monitor the exam across 104 centers in 30 states, while a central command center in New Delhi will supervise everything through live CCTV feeds.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/over-42000-candidates-to-take-fmge-on-saturday-nbems-deploys-4500-plus-personnel-live-cctv-surveillance/articleshow/135384736.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/over-42000-candidates-to-take-fmge-on-saturday-nbems-deploys-4500-plus-personnel-live-cctv-surveillance/articleshow/135384736.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T07:53:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135384801,imgsize-73981.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Dedication and ingenuity of our space scientists': PM Modi hails ISRO after successful GSLV-F18 launch carrying NVS-03]]></title><description>&lt;a 